# ofln does not require cloud LLM API keys.
# Optional Hugging Face tokens are entered in-app (Settings → HF Token)
# and stored in the device Keychain / Keystore — not in env files.
#
# Leave this file as a template. Copy to `.env` only if you add local
# tooling variables for your own scripts (never commit real secrets).

# Example (unused by the app runtime today):
# HF_TOKEN=
